HS_SSDO_RES = Screen Space Directional Occlusion
HS_SSDO_RES_DESC = Provides more accurate shading by sampling real ambient light rather than relying on approximations.
HS_SSDOSC = SSDO Sample Count
HS_SSDOSC_DESC = Sets how many samples SSDO calculates per pixel, improving the accuracy of shadows and ambient lighting.
HS_SSDODR = SSDO Dual Radii
HS_SSDODR_DESC = Improves subtle shadow detail using dual occlusion rays.
HS_SSAOTYPE = SSAO Type
HS_SSAOTYPE_DESC = Toggles between different SSAO application methods.
HS_DSQ = Deep Surface Quality
HS_DSQ_DESC = Sets the quality level for ground textures that include depth effects.
HS_AMVHP = Ambient Mask Volume High Precision
HS_AMVHP_DESC = Enables precise masking of shadows generated by ambient occlusion.







